From 30a4f1cd1b19133f3a9321204ecb05c205fcac6a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Alief <alief@sim-apotik.local>
Date: Sat, 29 Aug 2026 13:01:10 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat: manajemen user/role dari UI
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- UserPolicy: akses owner-only (viewAny/create/update), deactivate()
  khusus proteksi self-lockout
- Livewire MasterData/User/Index: list + modal create/edit, single
  role per user via syncRoles() konsisten dengan pola UserSeeder
- Proteksi: owner tidak bisa nonaktifkan/cabut role owner dari akun
  sendiri (bukan aturan farmasi, keputusan app-level)
- Reset password opsional saat edit (kosong = tidak berubah)
- Route /pengguna, nav link owner-only (desktop+mobile)
- Test: UserManagementTest (akses, create, self-lockout, edit role/
  status user lain, password blank on edit)

OPEN DECISION: dibatasi owner saja, admin tidak bisa akses — perlu
dikonfirmasi kalau mau diubah.
